{"id": "26d7bc30-652c-49d9-8749-3e78125ec42c", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:13:08.418907", "source": "user", "parent_id": "26dfed0c-00a0-4b9b-b229-e5fd8a9e9a8f", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"Begin with initial_inspection only. Inspect the repository at /workspace and any provided documents (e.g., track.md). Then propose: (1) an experiment design addressing whether scaling from llama-2-13b to llama-2-70b necessarily improves performance when pre-training is insufficient and alignment is under-refined, (2) the chosen conditions (model sizes, pre-training token budgets, alignment regimes, evaluation suites), (3) controls and confounds you would address, and (4) the analysis plan and feasibility note. Present this as a proposed approach — do not produce the full final design yet. Also list any assumptions you are making and any uncertainties you flag (budget, datasets, evaluation harness, decoding settings, hardware availability). Confirm the contract: this is a design-only deliverable; no experiment will be executed in this environment.\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"Does increasing model size (as in comparing llama-2-70b to llama-2-13b) necessarily yield improved performance, or can insufficient pre-training and a lack of refined alignment negate the benefits of a larger parameter count?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
